==============
PREREQUISITES
==============

sudo apt-get install build-essential git make pkg-config cmake ninja-build gnome-desktop-testing libasound2-dev libpulse-dev libaudio-dev libfribidi-dev libjack-dev libsndio-dev libx11-dev libxext-dev libxrandr-dev libxcursor-dev libxfixes-dev libxi-dev libxss-dev libxtst-dev libxkbcommon-dev libdrm-dev libgbm-dev libgl1-mesa-dev libgles2-mesa-dev libegl1-mesa-dev libdbus-1-dev libibus-1.0-dev libudev-dev libthai-dev

sudo apt-get install libpipewire-0.3-dev libwayland-dev libdecor-0-dev liburing-dev

Note: additional prereqs may be needed for the SDL_mixer build

xxx build procedure

===========================
SDL_MIXER BUILD ERROR  xxx DEL
===========================

If this SDL Mixer compile error occurs,

    In file included from /home/haid/proj/proj_qne2_branch/proj_qne2/linux/sdl_build/SDL_mixer/src/decoder_flac.c:57:
    .../sdl_build/SDL_mixer/src/SDL_mixer_loader.h:8:1: error: expected ‘,’ or ‘;’ before ‘typedef’
        8 | typedef struct {
          | ^~~~~~~

the SDL Mixer code needs to have ';' added to the end of this declaration:

    SDL_ELF_NOTE_DLOPEN(
        "flac",
        "Support for FLAC audio using libFLAC",
        SDL_ELF_NOTE_DLOPEN_PRIORITY_SUGGESTED,
        FLAC_DYNAMIC
    )

Steps:
- cd SDL_mixer/src
- vi decoder_flac.c decoder_fluidsynth.c decoder_gme.c decoder_mpg123.c decoder_opus.c decoder_vorbis.c decoder_wavpack.c decoder_xmp.c
- cd ../build
- cmake --build .
- cmake --install .


